<a:Name>request_dock_date</a:Name>
<a:Code>request_dock_date</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1758184755</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>gritm</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1758184755</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>gritm</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>根据客户需求由MRP推导出来的DockDate,RequestStockDate-DockToStockLT-Canlendar. 这里的LT如果启用了ConstrainPlanning,用Constrain来计算。Or RequestShipDate+Source.TransitCalendar+Source.TransitLT+Destination.Site.Calendar. 如果是工单，DockDate为完工日期。</a:Comment>
<a:History>ORG {0E79383F-5FF4-46C8-85DE-1CE704F47B10}
DAT 1758184767</a:History>
